        "answer": {
          "short": "$81$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\left(9^8\\right)^{\\frac14}&=9^{8\\times\\frac14}\\\\\\left(9^8\\right)^{\\frac14}&=9^2\\\\\\left(9^8\\right)^{\\frac14}&=81\\end{align*}$$",
